<title>NEW ZEALAND: Underground Fashions reports yr loss.</title>
<headline>Underground Fashions reports yr loss.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year result to July 31</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss			     2.67 vs 2.37 profit</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		    loss 10.6 vs 9.44 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover				27.5 vs 29.8</p>
<p>    Pretax loss			   2.67 vs 3.59 profit</p>
<p>    Tax				    0.004 vs 1.21</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)   25.20 vs same</p>
<p>Note - Underground Fashions Ltd is a women's clothing manufacturer and retailer.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
